[? if year = 1932 and month = 2 : The Anderson government buckles down on it's policy of retrenchment.?]

[? if year = 1932 and month = 4 : The Alberta Social Credit Party wins a majority in the provincial legislature. Our family in the Alberta CCF are deeply disturbed by the usurpation of what could've been a CCF stronghold. Aberhart's SCPS has already won over the the farmers of Albert. Is it possible the party could become just as infectious in Saskatchewan? ?]

